  "summary": "Malicious code in tron-toolkit (npm)",
  "details": "Tron-toolkit is a TRON wallet-drainer disguised as a developer utility. Its exported function performAdvancedOptimization(tronWeb, address, attacker) invokes tronWeb.transactionBuilder.accountPermissionUpdate(address, attacker, 1, [], []) and sends the signed transaction, granting the attacker's address owner permission over the victim's TRON account so funds can be stolen. The README describes the function as an 'Internal optimization function' to conceal its purpose.",
